{"title":"Gossamer Wing","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Gossamer Knight, Glamourweaver</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"gossamer-knight\" title=\"Gossamer Knight - dropped it in 76 of 122 looted corpses (1/1.6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f4c55c3eefcdac8bbb95.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gossamer Knight</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1–6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"glamourweaver\" title=\"Glamourweaver - dropped it in 21 of 35 looted corpses (1/1.7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ab8e44715f741cfa1e45.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glamourweaver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.7<br>×1–4</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gossamer-wing\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/scribing\">Scribing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/scroll-speed\">Speed Scroll</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Scribing 5</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/20293d1b1defcc2a16d0.svg\" alt=\"Gossamer Wing\"></div><h3>Gossamer Wing</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>1 recipe</td></tr>